6:29 ), לְסִיגִים הָיָה כַּסְמֵּךְ Isa 1:22 . 2 sliver as bright, shining , figurative of dove's wings בַכֶּ֑סֶף נֶחְמָּה יוֺנָה כַּנְפֵי Psa 68:14 . 3 silver, as wealth , Gen 13:2 (J) + often (c. 54 t. in all; frequently with gold, etc., see זהב ); כ ׳בֵיתוֺ וזהב מְלֹא Num 22:18 ; 24:13 ; figurative of a slave as valuable, הוּא כַּסְמּוֺ Exod 21:21 (all J E); silver as less valuable than gold 1Kin 10:21 2Chr 9:20 ; compare also 1Kin 10:27 2Chr 1:15 ; 9:27 ; ׳כ נִבְחָר choice silver , Prov 18:19 ; 10:20 . 4 silver as spoil of war (with זהב , q. v.) Judg 5:19 ; 2Sam 8:11 = 1Chr 18:11 11 t. 5 sliver as merchandise Ezek 27:12 ; Prov 3:14 ( ׳סְחַרכֿ ), Zeph 1:12 ; compare also 1Kin 10:22 2Chr 9:21 . 6 silver as costly gift (with זהב , q. v.) 1Kin 15:18-19 , 2Chr 16:2-3 , 2Kin 16:8 ; 18:15 ; 2Chr 9:14 ; 17:11 ; 21:3 ; Isa 60:9 ; Dan 11:38 (other instances under 8 ). 7 silver as material (c. 117 t. in all; often with זהב , q. v.), of cup Gen 44:2 compare 44:8 (J), trumpets Num 10:2 (P), ׳כְּלֵיכֿ Gen 24:53 (J) +; of idols Exod 20:23 ; Isa 2:20 ; Deut 29:16 ; Ezek 16:17 ; Psa 115:4 ; 135:15 4 t., compare Deut 7:25 ; Jer 10:4 ; Hab 2:19 ; especially of fittings of tabernacle Exodus 26.. 27. 36. 38. (19 t.), and those offered by chiefs of people Numbers 7 (28 t.), etc. 8 silver as measure of weight and value (c. 184 t.): — a. shekels : — ׳כ שְׁקָלִים שְׁלשִׁים Exod 21:32 (JE), compare 2Sam 24:24 ; Lev 5:15 ; Num 18:16 (both P), Neh 5:15 ; also (different order) כ שׁקלים ׳חֲמִשָּׁה Lev 27:6 (twice in verse) (P), compare Josh 7:21 (JE), 2Kin 15:20 , and י שֶׁקֶל מֵאֹת ׳אַרְבַּע Gen 23:15-16 , compare Lev 27:3 , 16 (all P), 1Sam 9:8 ; once הַכּ וַעֲשָׂרָה שְׁקָלִים ׳שִׁבְעָה Jer 32:9 . b. more often omitted שׁקל Gen 20:16 ; 45:22 (E), 37:28 (J), Hosea 3:2 ; Song 8:11 17t. c. talents : — (הַ)כּ ׳כִּכַּר Exod 38:27 (P), compare 1Kin 20:39 ; 2Kin 5:22 ; 15:19 ; 18:14 ; 23:33 2Chr 36:3 ; 1Chr 19:6 ; 2Chr 25:6 ; 27:5 ; Est 3:9 ; כִּכְּרֵיכֿ ׳עֶשֶׂר 2Kin 5:5 ; כ ׳כִּכְּרַיִם 1Kin 16:24 ; 2Kin 5:23 ; ׳כ ככרים אלפים אלף 1Chr 22:14 ; compare 29:7 ; Ezra 8:26 . d. minas : — ׳כ אֲלָפִים חֲמֵשֶׁת מָנִים Ezra 2:69 compare Neh 7:70-71 ,. e. more often = money , measure of value and exchange (c. 112 t.; not necess. coined ) Gen 31:15 ; 42:25 , 27 (E), 43:12 (twice in verse); 43:15 , 18 (J), 23:13 ; Lev 27:18 ; Num 3:48 (P), Judg 16:18 ; 1Kin 21:2 ; 2Kin 12:5 etc.; so Psa 68:31 Che, but see De Grill Bae, and Che critical note .; כ ׳מִקְנַת one bought for money Gen 17:12-13 , 23 , 27 ; Exod 12:44 (all P); ׳כ מִקְנָתוֺ Lev 25:51 (H) money for which he was bought ; ׳כ מָלֵא full price Gen 23:9 (P) 1Chr 21:22 , 24 ; בְּמִשְׁקָלוֺ כַּסְמֵּנוּ Gen 43:21 i.e. our money in full; ׳כ מִמְכָרוֺ Lev 25:50 the price of his sale ; ׳כ אָשָׁם 2Kin 12:7 trespass-money , ׳כ חַטָּאוֺת v. 12:7 sin-money , ׳כ הַכִּמֻּרִים Exod 30:16 atonement-money , ׳כ הַמִּדְיוֺן Num 3:49 redemption-money (both P); ׳כ עֶרְכְּךָ Lev 27:15 , 19 i.e. estimated value, etc. 9 among verbs and phrase with ׳כ are: — צרף try, refine , Zech 13:9 ; Isa 48:10 ; Mal 3:3 a Psa 12:7 ; 66:10 ; זִקַּק Mal 3:3 b, (compare הִתּוּךְ Ezek 22:22 , v נתך , see 22:20 ; 22:21 ); ימּה beautify ׳בכ Jer 10:4 ; כ ׳תָּפוּשׂ Hab 2:19 encased with gold and silver ; אתהַֿכּ ׳שָׁקַל לְ weigh out the silver to or for a person Jer 32:9 ; Gen 23:16 (P) Ezra 8:25 , without לְ Jer 32:10 , compare Exod 22:16 (E), 1Kin 20:39 ; כ ׳שׁקל ׳ב Isa 55:2 = spend money for ; כ יִשָּׁקֵל ׳לֹא מְחִירָהּ Job 28:15 ; כ שׁלשׁים אֶתשְֿׂכָרִי ׳וַיִּשְׁקְלוּ Zech 11:12 ; ׳כ ישׁקלו בַּקָּנֶה Isa 46:6 , of wighing material for idol; בכ ׳מָכַר sell for money Amos 2:6 ; Gen 37:28 (J), Deut 21:14 ; בכ ׳נָתַן 2:28 b 1Kin 21:6 , 15 ; Gen 23:9 (P), 1Chr 21:22 ; also, of food, ב ׳הִשְׁבִּיר Deut 2:28 a; כ ׳נתן השׂדה Gen 23:13 (P) pay the price of the field ; בְכ ׳קָנָה buy something for money Amos 8:6 ; Jer 32:25 , 44 ; Isa 43:24 ; 1Chr 21:24 , compare כ קִנְיַן נֶפֶשׁ ׳קָנָה Lev 22:11 (H); בכ ׳שׁבר Deut 2:6 a Isa 55:1 ; בכ ׳כרה Deut 2:6 b; peculiar is its use with מָּדָה , redeem (q. v.) in Num 18:16 ; כ ׳לקח receive money 2Kin 5:26 ; 12:8 ; 12:9 ; כ ׳לָוָה Neh 5:4 borrow money ; הִלְוָה Exod 22:24 (JE) lend money to (c. 2 accusative); כ ׳נתן בְּנֶשֶׁךְ give money on usury Lev 25:37 (H), Psa 15:5 ; compare כ נֶשֶׁךְ ׳לְאָחִיךָ תַשִּׁיךְ לֹא Deut 23:20 .","rootNote":"from 3700 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 18 10","keyReferences":["1Chr 18 10","1Chr 18 11","1Chr 19 6","1Chr 21 22","1Chr 21 24","1Chr 22 14","1Chr 22 16","1Chr 28 14"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":403,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 18 10","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":10,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וָ/כֶ֖סֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 11","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/כֶּ֨סֶף֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 19 6","book":"1Chr","chapter":19,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"כֶּ֗סֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 22","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/כֶ֤סֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 21 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":21,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/כֶ֣סֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 14","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/כֶ֗סֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 22 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":22,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לַ/כֶּ֛סֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 14","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/כֶּ֨סֶף֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 15","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/כֶּ֤סֶף","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"1Chr 28 16","book":"1Chr","chapter":28,"verse"